{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16862","headline":"灵门寺赠灵一上人 · 朱放","name":"灵门寺赠灵一上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"所思劳旦夕，惆怅去湘东。\n禅客知何在，春山几处同。\n独行残雪里，相见暮云中。\n请住东林寺，弥年事远公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱放","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}